# ── Reel folders (projects/<reel>/): text and code only ────────────────────────────────────────────
# The repo is public. Camera media, music, voice takes, renders, deliveries, fonts, models and anything
# copyrighted (songs, reference audio, lyric transcripts) stay on the director's Mac.
projects/*/**
!projects/*/**/
!projects/*/**/*.md
!projects/*/**/*.py
!projects/*/**/*.sh
!projects/*/**/*.swift
!projects/*/**/*.jsx
!projects/*/**/*.html
!projects/*/**/*.json
!projects/*/**/*.txt
# ...and these folders hold media or generated output whatever the extension
projects/*/raw/
projects/*/references/
projects/*/renders/
projects/*/analysis/
projects/*/transcripts/
projects/*/audio/
projects/*/music/
projects/*/sfx/
projects/*/grade/
projects/*/stock/
projects/**/renders/
projects/**/transcripts/
projects/**/.hyperframes/
projects/**/assets/
projects/**/node_modules/
projects/*/tools/realesrgan/
# The template is tracked whole (its empty folders keep a .gitkeep)
!projects/_template/**

# Studio assets: regenerable or licensed per file, never in git (setup.sh rebuilds the starter set)
assets/**/*
!assets/**/
!assets/**/.gitkeep

# ── Personal, kept on this Mac only ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# setup.sh creates director-profile.md from director-profile.example.md; scripts append to the ledgers.
studio/director-profile.md
studio/ledger/*.jsonl
# Set aside (studio/BACKLOG.md): unreviewed Gemini additions, one of which publishes to Instagram directly
GEMINI_IG_STUDIO_INTEGRATION.md
scripts/gemini_ig_studio_cli.py
scripts/gemini_setup_premiere_mcp.sh

# ── Environments, secrets, vendored tools, local state ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
.vendor/
.claude/state/
.claude/settings.local.json
*.prproj.lock

# Third-party skills: reinstalled by setup.sh, pinned in skills-lock.json. Studio-owned skills stay tracked.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/cinematic-reel/
!.claude/skills/studio-hq/
# Imported and modified with studio fixes (MIT, licence in the folder): tracked as a studio fork, not reinstalled.
!.claude/skills/ffmpeg-color-grading-chromakey/
!.claude/skills/film-emulation-prompts/

# Premiere project files, auto-saves and caches (saved by Premiere, not versioned here)
*.prproj
*.prin
**/Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/
**/Adobe Premiere Pro Audio Previews/
**/Adobe Premiere Pro Video Previews/

# OS, Python, build output
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
scripts/bin/
